B.biU=s(["Kreyasyon an pa konfime. Kenbe menm demann lan epi eseye ank\xf2.","La cr\xe9ation n\u2019est pas confirm\xe9e. Conservez la m\xeame demande et r\xe9essayez.","Creation is not confirmed. Keep the same request and retry."],t.s)
B.b9P=s(["Tw\xf2p demann. Tann yon ti moman epi eseye ank\xf2.","Trop de demandes. Patientez puis r\xe9essayez.","Too many requests. Wait before trying again."],t.s)
B.biy=s(["Adr\xe8s aplikasyon Web la pa otorize sou s\xe8v\xe8 a.","L\u2019origine de l\u2019application Web n\u2019est pas autoris\xe9e sur le serveur.","The web application origin is not allowed by the server."],t.s)
B.bnK=s(["Yon l\xf2t moun modifye sal la. Lis la pral rafrechi; verifye li anvan ou eseye ank\xf2.","La salle a \xe9t\xe9 modifi\xe9e ailleurs. La liste va \xeatre actualis\xe9e ; v\xe9rifiez-la avant de r\xe9essayer.","The gym was changed elsewhere. The list will refresh; review it before trying again."],t.s)
