B.bEJ=s(["Idantifikasyon byometrik ultra-rapid pa anprent USB. Pa gen kat pou p\xe8di oswa prete : chak manm antre an sekirite absoli.","Identification biom\xe9trique instantan\xe9e par empreinte USB. Fini les cartes perdues ou pr\xeat\xe9es : acc\xe8s s\xe9curis\xe9 et infalsifiable.","Instant biometric identification via USB fingerprint reader. No cards to lose or share: secure, tamper-proof access for every member."],t.s)
